, "playtime_forever": 12025, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2492, "last_played": 1769977975, "avatar": "c1b2ae7633d9c098a59c9a3b40acc2e5cdb150c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nobody is talking about this game and it is criminal. I saw somebody playing this on youtube and decided to pick it up, because it just looked fun. This game is now one of my favorites. The invasion system is just amazing. The gun handling, breathing, weapon variety, level design. All great.", "timestamp_created": 1763152564, "timestamp_updated": 1763152653, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209166318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014675871", "personaname": "TITANTOR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TITANTOR/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3527, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 108, "playtime_at_review": 529, "last_played": 1790484527, "avatar": "556d97992e0976f1603a7b59b1bb947d7c369a1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played SE 4,5, and now Resistance.  I have been waiting for some less linear maps, and this had some advancement in that department.  This series is just plain fun, and I am happy they don't change the formula too much, just enough, and realize we just want more maps and cooperative fun..", "timestamp_created": 1763088205, "timestamp_updated": 1763088205, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209156363", "author": {"steamid": "76561199088190189", "personaname": "Bespin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199088190189/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 379, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 379, "last_played": 1763069306, "avatar": "43789e8f7c3948b2482ed0dc4becb2e69467077c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Glorified SE5 DLC not worth anything more then like £15", "timestamp_created": 1763076097, "timestamp_updated": 1763076097, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "209145307", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993318561", "personaname": "Cam", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/suprememooselord/", "num_games_owned": 888, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 908, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 908, "last_played": 1762991074, "avatar": "e156dc927decc9b518486fcb42be3f0adb0eff25"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"No\" since there's no mixed option. \n\nThis game has some good levels, fun sniping moments, etc. There's a lot I liked, but there's nothing I liked more than SE5, so from the perspective of someone who owned that I can't recommend this. \n\nThis game's slight edge in level design doesn't offset buggier AI and worse production values. \n\nI'd love another game with Harry Hawker as the protagonist, though, that was a fun element.\n\nNo, but if you LOVE Sniper Elite and you like the sound of playing as Harry for a change then on sale it doesn't feel too bad of a buy. Made me want to go play more of 5 in the end though.", "timestamp_created": 1763065336, "timestamp_updated": 1763065336, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209096597", "author": {"steamid": "76561199088034143", "personaname": "buzztdm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199088034143/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 2954, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2439, "last_played": 1788325107, "avatar": "a2759acabe2cd649b6b7b6524da4372ce001040d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love sniper elite... so much fun", "timestamp_created": 1763014951, "timestamp_updated": 1763014951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209034763", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005353722", "personaname": "🍣  Darklord77 🍣", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/darklord77/", "num_games_owned": 909, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 1217, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1212, "last_played": 1787594591, "avatar": "8c99fa0a8cfc437c6f8a84b3ab6fb291c1c53d35"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite is a bit recycle from sniper elite 5 I sill enjoy all the content that this game has", "timestamp_created": 1762959573, "timestamp_updated": 1762959573, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions